        entries=[('compass-effects',transfer,'Full cross-assay transfer protocol reviewed; reported 4618 mutations/88 genes apply after exact overlap and shared-gene removal. The public packaged BEND2 task registry has no COMPASS target ID or frozen per-mutation cohort manifest, so an independent recount of these paper-filtered rows is unavailable from that release.'),('compass-interaction',interaction,'Full interaction-cohort and nonadditivity protocol reviewed. Reported single/double-mutant counts apply to 110 genes and retain shared genes; no frozen BEND-specific mutation manifest or scored interaction table is supplied in the inspected packaged release.'),('trip-efficiency',trip,'Full four-system fitting/splitting and uncertainty protocol reviewed. The paper gives 1196 integration locations, not separate retained counts per editing system; it does not enumerate the exact chromosome-to-fold assignment or final per-system filtered coordinate manifest.'),('mage-expression',mage,'Full personal-sequence control protocol reviewed. Exact donor/fold memberships, retained person×gene outcome matrix and run-specific covariate matrix are not released with the inspected packaged task registry. 729 people and 557 genes are separate reported cohort dimensions, not a measured complete Cartesian product.')]
